      "For consistency, a [smart Wi-Fi plug-in diffuser](/product/autivora-smart-plug-diffuser) is worth adding to an entryway or hallway specifically because you can schedule it — set it to run during the hours you're actually home, the same way a store runs its scent system during open hours and off overnight. That scheduled, low-and-steady approach is a big part of why store scents feel so consistently 'there' without ever feeling heavy-handed.",
      "[[cta]]Shop the 4L Humidifying Diffuser|/product/autivora-4l-humidifying-diffuser",
      "## Placing your diffuser like a retail store would",
