      "### What essential oil smells most like the Lululemon store scent?",
      "There's no single essential oil that replicates a multi-note fragrance blend, but eucalyptus is the note people cite most often when describing the Lululemon experience, followed by light citrus and a soft musk base. A blended fragrance oil built around that eucalyptus-and-citrus profile, like [Eucalyptus Mint](/scents/eucalyptus-mint), gets you much closer than any single raw essential oil on its own.",
