      "This isn't a claim that a diffuser will fix your focus or replace sleep, movement, and a real break schedule. It's simpler than that. Certain scent families are commonly associated with alertness and energy, and other families are built for the opposite job — unwinding, softening a room, easing you toward sleep. Put the wrong one at your desk and you're working against yourself without realizing it. This guide covers which scent families to reach for, four specific oils worth keeping at your desk, exact blend ratios, and which diffuser actually makes sense for a WFH setup.",
      "## Why some scents read as alert and others read as sedating",
